{"id":"07005","root":"uni07005_1","name":{"ja":"オーガ奴隷","en":"Ogre Slave"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"オーガ奴隷","en":"Ogre Slave"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Oni"],"release":"2020-05-16","limited":true,"characterId":288,"profile":{"ja":"魔界に住まう下級鬼族。オーガ族とも呼ばれる。強靭な肉体と凶暴な性格を持つが、知能は低い。人肉を好み、オーク同様様々な種族の女を孕ませる事が出来る。調教されたオーガは高値で取引され、護衛用の奴隷や闘技場の闘奴として用いられる。","en":"They are a lower-class demon tribe that inhabits the Demon Realm, also known as the Ogre tribe. They possess a robust physique and a violent temperament, but their intelligence is low. They have a preference for human flesh and, like Orcs, can impregnate females of various species. Trained Ogres are traded at high prices and are used as slave guards or gladiators in arenas."},"illustrator":null,"voiceActor":"シヴァ伊月","forms":[{"id":"uni07005_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1142,2284],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[195,390],"def":[86,172],"spd":[53,53],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":41,"skills":["1","590001"]},{"id":"uni07005_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1734,3468],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[321,642],"def":[103,206],"spd":[53,53],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":41,"skills":["1","590001","590002"]},{"id":"uni07005_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2326,4647],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[449,899],"def":[122,245],"spd":[53,53],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":41,"skills":["1","590001","590002","590003"]}],"skills":{"1":{"slot":"attack","id":1,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Superhuman damage"}]},"590001":{"slot":"skill1","id":590001,"name":{"ja":"無差別ブロウ"},"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵３体に小威力で攻撃する"}},{"lev